 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `Files.Upload`, which takes a file name and an `io.Reader` and encodes
+  the multipart body internally, with `WithUpload*` options for the deal,
+  person, organization, product, activity, lead and project association
+  fields. The body is buffered in memory, so uploads retry on rate limits and
+  transient errors even when the source reader is not replayable.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Requests whose body is an `io.ReadSeeker` (for example an `*os.File` passed
+  to `Files.Add` or `Raw.Do`) are now replayed on 429/502/503/504. Previously
+  only `bytes`/`strings` readers were replayable, so uploads failed
+  immediately on the first rate-limit response regardless of the configured
+  retry policy. Closing a seekable body stays with the caller.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
